Changes in this fork (1.1.0):
- StickerAnchorPick takes optional fallback_masks, used when no head is under the sticker,
  and returns on_head.
- StickerTrack takes reid (wire on_head to it): a sticker on something that is not a head hides
  when its subject is lost instead of re-identifying onto a person after a cut.
- StickerTrack takes hide_occluded / occluded_below / occluded_frames (off by default): hide while
  the points under the sticker are covered.
